WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:26.350
Ask for a sourced view of a fictional customer.

2
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:42.450
Supply the email for this fictional customer.

3
00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:52.900
The answer combines customer facts with a source beside each one.

4
00:00:53.800 --> 00:01:03.850
Open the original customer record from the synthetic CRM export.

5
00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:11.550
The synthetic mailbox export keeps its original address format.

6
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.600
Open the workflow that brings the source records together.

7
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.450
Follow the demo consolidation request into its workflow run.

8
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:41.850
Fixed rules gather, clean, match and link the source records.

9
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:50.100
The phone rule also requires the same full name.

10
00:01:50.850 --> 00:02:00.000
The sourced customer views keep linked order totals alongside their facts.

11
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:07.750
The review board holds possible matches for a steward's decision.

12
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:14.350
A name-only possible match waits on the demo review board.

13
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:26.900
An automated test records a steward decision on the synthetic pair.

14
00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:38.600
The demo decision applies while the other possible matches stay queued.

15
00:02:38.900 --> 00:03:06.650
A demo chat visitor supplies an email as an unverified identity claim.

16
00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:12.450
The chat answers the visitor's question while identity remains an unverified claim.

17
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:27.500
An automated test adds the chat visitor to its demo board through MCP.

18
00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:43.040
The visitor's unverified identity claim stays separate from the sourced customer view.
